<div class="space-y-5">
  <div>
    <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1">WhatsApp Chat</h4>
    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">Send and receive WhatsApp messages in real-time. Conversations are automatically created when customers message your number or when you initiate contact.</p>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">How to Use</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li>Select a conversation from the left panel to open it</li>
      <li>Type a message and press <strong>Enter</strong> to send (Shift+Enter for new line)</li>
      <li>Use the <strong>paperclip icon</strong> to attach images, videos, audio, or documents</li>
      <li>Use the <strong>clock icon</strong> to schedule a message for later</li>
      <li>Type <strong>/</strong> to see quick response suggestions</li>
      <li>Click <strong>Search Messages</strong> to find content across all conversations</li>
      <li>Click the <strong>person icon</strong> in the chat header to assign a conversation</li>
      <li>Click <strong>Send to Lead</strong> to create or link a lead from a conversation</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">Rules & Limits</h5>
    <ul class="text-xs text-gray-600 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4">
      <li><strong>24-hour window:</strong> You can only send free-form messages within 24 hours of the customer's last message. After that, use approved templates.</li>
      <li><strong>Message length:</strong> Maximum 4,096 characters per message.</li>
      <li><strong>Media limits:</strong> Images up to 5 MB, Videos up to 16 MB, Documents up to 100 MB, Audio up to 16 MB.</li>
      <li><strong>Supported formats:</strong> Images (JPEG, PNG), Videos (MP4, 3GPP), Audio (AAC, MP3, OGG, AMR), Documents (PDF, DOC, XLS, PPT).</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div>
    <h5 class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-700 mb-2">Common Errors</h5>
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"WhatsApp API is not configured"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">API credentials have not been set up. Go to WhatsApp > Settings and enter your Phone Number ID, Access Token, and activate the connection.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Message too long"</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">Your message exceeds 4,096 characters. Shorten the text and try again.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Re-engagement message" / Template required</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">The 24-hour reply window has expired. Send an approved template from the Marketing section first.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-100 p-3">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-800">"Failed" status on sent message</p>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-red-600 mt-1">Common causes: invalid phone number, recipient not opted in, blocked number, or API rate limits exceeded.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
